From: askimi <44218719+RNI4114@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:25:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dlss-jay: coopmat 16x16x16 split, vector/block cmat
 loads, Jay phi RA affinity, Large GRF for DPAS, ANV_CM_OFF

Saved before removing dlss-xmx; base for fs4-xmx.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../brw/brw_nir_lower_cooperative_matrix.c    | 115 +++++++++++++++--
 src/intel/compiler/jay/jay_from_nir.c         | 122 +++++++++++++++++-
 src/intel/compiler/jay/jay_partition.c        |  13 ++
 .../compiler/jay/jay_register_allocate.c      |  22 ++--
 src/intel/vulkan/anv_physical_device.c        |  22 +++-
 src/intel/vulkan/anv_private.h                |   1 +
 src/intel/vulkan/anv_shader_compile.c         |   7 +
 src/intel/vulkan/genX_cmd_compute.c           |   6 +-
